sequenceDiagram
    actor Keeper as "Warehouse Keeper/Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Inv as "inventoryService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Keeper->>UI: Enter receipt lines (warehouse, SKU, expiry, quantity)
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/goods-receipts
    API->>Inv: Create receipt
    Inv->>DB: Validate warehouse scope and batch fields
    Inv->>DB: Save Draft/Submitted receipt, no stock increase
    API-->>-UI: Receipt awaiting approval
    Keeper->>UI: Approve receipt when authorized
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/goods-receipts/{id}/approve
    API->>Inv: Approve with idempotency/version
    Inv->>DB: Transactionally create/merge batch and increase OnHand
    Inv->>DB: Create QR labels and inventory transaction
    alt First approval
        DB-->>API: Received and inventory updated
    else Duplicate retry
        DB-->>API: Existing approval result, no double increase
    end



